{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00740","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享懿德太子庙乐章 迎俎酌献 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享懿德太子庙乐章 迎俎酌献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雍雍盛典，肃肃灵祠。\n宾天有圣，对日无期。\n飘颻羽服，掣曳云旗。\n眷言主鬯，心乎怆兹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}